  "title": "Data Science Interview Questions: Ace your interview",
  "summary": "When you’re trying to break into a data science career, you have plenty of items on your to-do list. One of the most intimidating tasks on that list is interviewing for jobs. But with the right information (like the details in this blog post!), you can ace that interview. First, find out the most common data science interview questions, listed below. Then take the expert advice we outline on data science interview preparation. Finally, go out and get that data scientist role!",
